{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G1-05","example":{"issue":{"title":"斜交路口的轉向視距、停車及行人空間問題","intro":"主要道路寬約 15 m、次要道路寬約 6.5 m，速限均為 30 km/h。周邊以住宅為主，主要道路兩側有路邊停車需求。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-05-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-05-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-05-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g1-05-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"斜交轉角影響來車觀察","text":"次要道路與主要道路交角較小，且轉角鄰近建物，駕駛進入主要道路時不易觀察橫向來車。"},{"id":"space","title":"停車與行車空間未明確區分","text":"主要道路外側同時供行車及路邊停車使用，缺少明確的路面邊線，車行範圍不易辨識。"},{"id":"speed","title":"路口警示與速限提示不足","text":"主要道路缺少次要道路來車警示，速限資訊多依賴路面標字，標誌提示不完整。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[68,69],"strategy":{"title":"路側停車、學校接送臨停及轉角空間配置","intro":"配合住宅區停車需求與鄰近學校的臨時停車需求，區分停放、行車及行人空間。","images":[{"key":"results:g1-05-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"parking","title":"設置嵌入式路邊停車位","text":"將汽車停車格配置於路側停車帶，並以路面邊線區分停車與行車空間。","moduleId":"M1-03"},{"id":"pickup","title":"設置臨時停車彎","text":"配合鄰近學校的接送需求，局部調整人行道路緣形成臨停彎，並劃設禁止停車線，區分臨停與禁止停車範圍。"},{"id":"corner","title":"調整轉角人行空間","text":"配合人行道路緣外擴調整轉角線形及轉彎半徑，並考量行人穿越位置與轉彎車輛的衝突。","moduleId":"M3-01"},{"id":"priority","title":"補充路口導引與停車管制","text":"於路口劃設行車導引線，並搭配禁止停車、禁止臨時停車標誌及標線，明確標示路側停車管制範圍。","moduleId":"M1-03"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-1-05-unsignalized-urban-skewed-t.typ","sha256":"5b98483294db3e43dffeadd32eb6515704f966fa5584acb6ec3509fafb7288ee","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g1-05-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-05/G1-05_現況圖_01.png","width":3000,"height":2225,"label":"G1-05 現況圖","scenario":"G1-05","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":68,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image77.png","sha256":"6caec6e8bfde382eed3bfd96fc65ec96d5e54b3d521e4adc59737b35dd1bbe62"},"results:g1-05-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-05/G1-05_現況照片_01.png","width":2572,"height":1412,"label":"G1-05 現況照片","scenario":"G1-05","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":69,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image79.png","sha256":"3d5d1605796a8d6772d472367aea1f402b3d2bc7463b9ad4dc531c0709270b57"},"results:g1-05-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-05/G1-05_現況照片_02.png","width":2583,"height":1477,"label":"G1-05 現況照片 2","scenario":"G1-05","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":69,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image80.png","sha256":"b378bf744b4bf5bd6ce9b33ef22e9e018208e4eafaae1481ce4284d44118f3c8"},"results:g1-05-photo-3":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G1-05/G1-05_現況照片_03.png","width":2587,"height":1402,"label":"G1-05 現況照片 3","scenario":"G1-05","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":69,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image78.png","sha256":"4890c9cc426d2d9cafdbd2d69fcd07190712e2c10eb5a5bfa9a14022765d830a"},"results:g1-05-strategy":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/G1-05/G1-05_無號誌市區斜交三叉路口交通設施整體設置圖例.svg","width":1097,"height":544,"label":"G1-05 整體佈設圖","scenario":"G1-05","role":"strategy","sha256":"8e6abca1278e47bc0ef47ecfedd9a5afe0cd6dbf6d6cab4424c3a7d9c088138f"}}}
